					"content": "Not yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740580404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740580404,
					"content": "Well, the craftsmen are still processing the previous sample, so it's not too urgent...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740580405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chesil"
				},
				{
					"id": 740580405,
					"content": "But if we managed to get our hands on more supplies, the craftsmen might just become newly inspired, eh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740580406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chesil"
				},
				{
					"id": 740580406,
					"content": "I'll still be here waiting for your good news.",
